<title>USA: Imperial Bancorp names president.</title>
<headline>Imperial Bancorp names president.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Bank said Daniel Mathis was named president and chief operating officer, succeeding Norman Creighton as president.</p>
<p>Creighton, who will continue to serve as chief executive officer, was also named vice chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Mathis previously served as executive vice president for Imperial's southern California and Arizona regions.</p>
